# 🔐 AES-128 Encryption/Decryption Project (Python)

A complete implementation of AES-128 encryption and decryption in pure Python. Includes:

- 🧠 From-scratch AES core (SubBytes, ShiftRows, MixColumns, Key Expansion)
- 📂 File encryption/decryption tool (CLI-based)
- 🖼 GUI-based text & file encrypter using Tkinter

